@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.api"

Feature: Trigger Validation
	Validating triggers in zendesk

Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical BR
	The Brazil Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - BR" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is     | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is     | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is     | High                        |
	| Support Region             | Is     | Brazil                      |
	| Group                      | Is     |                             |
	| Partner First Line Support | Is     | false                       |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - BR" should have "8" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - BR" should assign the ticket to the "group" "CSE - BR - Platinum Critical"

Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical CN
	The China Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - CN" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is     | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is     | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is     | High                        |
	| Within (schedule)          | Is     | CN - Schedule               |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Brazil                      |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Japan                       |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Australia                   |
	| Partner First Line Support | Is     | false                       |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - CN" should have "10" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - CN" should assign the ticket to the "group" "CSE - CN - Platinum Critical"

