Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical US weekday
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	The US Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US weekday" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is          | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is          | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is          | High                        |
	| Support Region             | Is not      | Brazil                      |
	| Partner First Line Support | Is          | false                       |
	| Product                    | Is not      | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not      | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	| Sub Organization           | Not present |                             |
	| Support Region             | Is not      | Spain                       |
	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US weekday" should have the following properties under the any conditions
	| Within (schedule) | Is | US - Schedule |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US weekday" should have "10" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - US weekday" should assign the ticket to the "group" "CSE - US - Platinum Critical"

