Scenario: Assign Spain Platinum Critical to Platinum Critical US
	The Spain Platinum Critical to US Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign Spain Platinum Critical to Platinum Critical - US" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is          | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is          | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is          | High                        |
	| Support Region             | Is          | Spain                       |
	| Product                    | Is not      | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not      | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	* the trigger "Assign Spain Platinum Critical to Platinum Critical - US" should have the following properties under the any conditions
	| Within (schedule) | Is | US - Schedule         |
	| Within (schedule) | Is | US - Weekend Schedule |
	And the trigger "Assign Spain Platinum Critical to Platinum Critical - US" should have "8" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign Spain Platinum Critical to Platinum Critical - US" should assign the ticket to the "group" "CSE - US - Platinum Critical"

Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical LXC SM CN
	The CN LXC SM Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - LXC - SM - CN" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type       | Is           | Create                      |
	| Product           | Is not       | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product           | Is           | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	| Support Region    | Is           | China                       |
	| Within (schedule) | Is           | CN - Schedule               |
	| Priority          | Greater than | Normal                      |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - LXC - SM - CN" should have "6" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - LXC - SM - CN" should assign the ticket to the "group" "LXC - SM - CN"

