Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical LXC SM AU NZ
	The AU/NZ LXC SM Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - LXC - SM - AU/NZ" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type       | Is     | Create                      |
